#: src/addeditblog.cpp:72
msgid "Add a new blog"
msgstr "Dodati novi blog"

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:89
msgid "Edit blog settings"
msgstr "Uredi postavke bloga"

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:130
msgid "You have to set the username, password and URL of your blog or website."
msgstr ""
"Morate postaviti korisničko ime, lozinku i URL na svoj blog ili web stranicu."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:131
msgid "Incomplete fields"
msgstr "Nepotpuna polja"

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:134
msgid "Trying to guess blog and API type..."
msgstr "Pokušaj pogađanja bloga i API tipa ..."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:182 src/addeditblog.cpp:245
msgid ""
"Auto configuration failed. You have to set Blog API on Advanced tab manually."
msgstr ""
"Auto configuration nije uspjelo. Morate postaviti Blog API na kartici "
"Napredno ručno."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:248
msgid ""
"The program could not guess the API of your blog, but has found an XMLRPC "
"interface and is trying to use it.\n"
"The MovableType API is assumed for now; choose another API if you know the "
"server supports it."
msgstr ""
"Program nije mogao pogoditi API za vaš blog, ali je pronašao XMLRPC sučelje "
"i pokušava ga koristiti.\n"
"MovableType API pretpostavlja se, za sada, izaberite neki drugi API ako "
"znate ga poslužitelj podržava."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, operationNameLabel)
#: src/addeditblog.cpp:300 src/waitwidgetbase.ui:19
msgid "Please wait..."
msgstr "Molim sačekajte..."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:302
msgid "Fetching Blog Id..."
msgstr "Preuzimam Blog Id..."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:317
msgid ""
"Fetching the blog id timed out. Check your Internet connection,and your "
"homepage URL, username or password.\n"
"Note that the URL has to contain \"http://\"\n"
"If you are using a self-hosted Wordpress blog, you have to enable Remote "
"Publishing in its configuration."
msgstr ""
"Dobavljanje blog id isteklo. Provjerite svoje internetske veze, i svoju "
"početnu stranicu URL, korisničko ime ili lozinka.\n"
"Imajte na umu da URL mora sadržavati \"http://\"\n"
"Ako koristite kod vas hostiran  Wordpress blog, morate omogućiti udaljeno "
"objavljivanje u svojoj konfiguraciji."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:330
msgid ""
"The API guess function has failed, please check your Internet connection. "
"Otherwise, you have to set the API type manually on the Advanced tab."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija API pogađanja nije uspjela, provjerite vašu internetsku vezu. "
"Inače, morate postaviti API tip ručno na kartici Napredno."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:332
msgid "Auto Configuration Failed"
msgstr "Autokonfiguracija pala"

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:341
msgid ""
"Fetching BlogID Failed.\n"
"Please check your Internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Dobavljanje BlogID nije uspjelo.\n"
"Provjerite internetsku vezu."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:377
msgid "Which blog?"
msgstr "Koji blog?"

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:394
msgid "Sorry, No blog found with the specified account info."
msgstr ""

